{"id":"lerik","qid":"Q2090598","category":"city","type":"oikonym","names":{"az":"Lerik","ru":"Лерик","en":"Lerik"},"coordinates":[48.41528,38.77528],"coordinatesSource":"wd","region":"lenkeran-astara","regionSource":"wp-az-regions","admin":[{"qid":"Q688626","az":"Lerik rayonu","en":"Lerik District"}],"firstRecord":null,"period":null,"forms":[],"namedAfter":[],"etymology":[],"summary":{"az":{"text":"Lerik — Azərbaycan Respublikasının Lerik rayonunun Lerik şəhər inzibati ərazi dairəsində şəhər, Lerik rayonunun inzibati mərkəzi.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-az"},"ru":{"text":"Лерик (азерб. Lerik, тал. Lik) — город на юге Азербайджана, около границы с Ираном, центр Лерикского района. Город расположен в Талышских горах, в 56 км от Ленкорани.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-ru"},"en":{"text":"Lerik is the capital city of Lerik District in the southern area of Azerbaijan not far from the Iranian border. It is located in the Talysh Mountains, a northwestern subrange of the Alborz (Elburz) mountain range. The majority of the population is Talysh.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-en"}},"images":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e6/Lerik_Heyd%C9%99r_%C6%8Fliyev_M%C9%99rk%C9%99zi_-_2.jpg/960px-Lerik_Heyd%C9%99r_%C6%8Fliyev_M%C9%99rk%C9%99zi_-_2.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","small":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e6/Lerik_Heyd%C9%99r_%C6%8Fliyev_M%C9%99rk%C9%99zi_-_2.jpg/960px-Lerik_Heyd%C9%99r_%C6%8Fliyev_M%C9%99rk%C9%99zi_-_2.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","width":800,"height":490,"page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lerik_Heyd%C9%99r_%C6%8Fliyev_M%C9%99rk%C9%99zi_-_2.jpg","title":"Lerik Heydər Əliyev Mərkəzi - 2.jpg","artist":"Tərxan Paşazadə","credit":"Own work","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","source":"img-1"}],"sources":[{"id":"wd","kind":"wikidata"